      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bear_Grass%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A 1981 sculpture of a rampant bear now stands proudly in front of the town’s school.",
