      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bear_Grass%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1987, a George Washington statue was commissioned for the Constitution bicentennial and placed at the former teacherage.",
